---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Provoked | Todd Kashdan's Newsletter" current="provoked">
  <div class="wrap page-hero">
    <p class="kicker">An unusual look at what everyone accepts</p>
    <h1>Get <em>Provoked</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Cultivate a curious mind and flexible thinking. Todd's newsletter takes an unusual look at commonly accepted practices and current events, read by over 5 million people, free and premium.</p>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a class="btn solid" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join free</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/subscribe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Go premium &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="sec-h"><h2>Recent issues</h2><a href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/archive" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Full archive &rarr;</a></div>
    <div class="post-grid">
      <a class="post-card" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/p/was-your-childhood-unsatisfactory" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!oZco!,w_640,h_426,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_center/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F348fa64e-9526-4849-811b-3868087ecb79_1122x1402.png" alt="Was Your Childhood Unsatisfactory? cover image" />
        <div class="post-card-body">
          <h3>Was Your Childhood Unsatisfactory? Answer Ten Questions and Find Out</h3>
          <p>The interesting science of adolescent necessities and what they teach us about American youth.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="post-card" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/p/punish-people-chicken-suits" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!fBoa!,w_640,h_426,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_center/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8462a944-f715-454b-8828-401d55ccc004_1122x1402.png" alt="Punish People by Making Them Wear a Chicken Suit cover image" />
        <div class="post-card-body">
          <h3>Punish People by Making Them Wear a Chicken Suit</h3>
          <p>A plug for creative, kinder punishments for parents and the criminal justice system.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="post-card" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/p/skipping-leg-day-and-making-friends" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cM-A!,w_640,h_426,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_center/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F3b593303-16b0-4221-830b-7fcad1383552_1122x1402.png" alt="Skipping Leg Day and Making Friends at the Gym cover image" />
        <div class="post-card-body">
          <h3>Skipping Leg Day and Making Friends at the Gym</h3>
          <p>Asking a stranger a question you think is stupid makes you look smarter.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="post-card" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/p/how-to-be-funnier-11-strategies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gONC!,w_640,h_426,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_center/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb15d5ecf-9e0d-4794-94b4-1da988c84f2c_1024x1536.png" alt="How to Be Funnier cover image" />
        <div class="post-card-body">
          <h3>How to Be Funnier: 11 Strategies According to Science and an Old Canadian Show</h3>
          <p>Use these 11 strategies for being humorous when writing or socializing.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="post-card" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/p/a-bunch-of-high-school-nerds" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!j9JK!,w_640,h_426,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_center/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4588894d-1e25-4901-ad9b-b86d77344cfc_1024x1536.png" alt="A Bunch of High School Nerds on a Power Trip cover image" />
        <div class="post-card-body">
          <h3>A Bunch of High School Nerds on a Power Trip, Part I</h3>
          <p>With only a few terrible actors, your workplace can be excruciating.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="post-card" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/p/the-blue-trash-bag-theory" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!e9YG!,w_640,h_426,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_center/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7bfa0f43-6c72-4c7e-abb1-2e26e3a30c3b_1055x1491.png" alt="The Blue Trash Bag Theory of Human Nature cover image" />
        <div class="post-card-body">
          <h3>The Blue Trash Bag Theory of Human Nature</h3>
          <p>How psychological needs and goals differ around the world.</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section wrap">
    <div class="news">
      <div>
        <p class="news-eyebrow">Free &amp; Premium</p>
        <h2>Thought-provoking ideas to your inbox.</h2>
        <p>No spam, no fluff. Just Todd's take on curiosity, purpose, and the science of a better life.</p>
        <div class="news-proof">Trusted by <strong>10,000+</strong> subscribers</div>
      </div>
      <div class="news-cta">
        <a class="btn solid" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join free</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="https://toddkashdan.substack.com/subscribe" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Go premium &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
